{"ideviceId":"idevice-mvux20lk-4cgq952c8","textInfoDurationInput":"","textInfoDurationTextInput":"Duración","textInfoParticipantsInput":"","textInfoParticipantsTextInput":"Agrupamiento","textTextarea":"<table cellpadding="10" style="width: 100.015%; background-color: #bfedd2;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 99.925%;">
<p>Además, si \(\vec{u} = (u_1, u_2, u_3)\) y \(\vec{v} = (v_1, v_2, v_3)\), se cumple que</p>
<h4><span style="color: #007632;"><strong>\[ \vec{u} \bullet \vec{v} = |\vec{u}| \cdot |\vec{v}| \cdot \cos(\widehat{\vec{u}, \vec{v}}) \]</strong></span></h4>
</td>
